WEBVTT

00:00:00.433 --> 00:00:02.467
Are you a SMART fella...

00:00:02.467 --> 00:00:04.533
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.533 --> 00:00:06.800
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.867 --> 00:00:10.333
Question ten! Which one does NOT

00:00:10.333 --> 00:00:13.333
belong? Add... subtract...

00:00:13.333 --> 00:00:16.300
multiply... number. A,

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:19.100
add... B, subtract...

00:00:19.367 --> 00:00:22.100
C, multiply... or D,

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:24.733
number? Five seconds!

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:32.933
TIME'S UP! Pencils down!

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:35.833
It's... D, number!

00:00:35.833 --> 00:00:38.500
Add, subtract, and multiply are

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:39.800
all things you do.

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:40.767
But a number?

00:00:40.767 --> 00:00:43.067
That's the thing you do them to!

00:00:44.033 --> 00:00:46.967
So, are you smart or fart?

00:00:46.967 --> 00:00:48.733
Count up your correct answers to

00:00:48.733 --> 00:00:50.367
find your rank!

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:52.800
So, how did you do?

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:54.233
Comment your score below,

00:00:54.233 --> 00:00:55.900
and follow for more!
